             SHORT="GTK input method module for Fcitx5"

cat << EOF
fcitx5-gtk provides the GTK input method module that lets GTK
applications talk to Fcitx5.

The module is installed as im-fcitx5.so into the GTK immodules directory
and registered through GTK_IM_MODULE=fcitx5.
EOF
